WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>EBIYA</b>

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.460
Hello, granny.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.580
I'd like a taiyaki waffle please!

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:12.960
Oh, hey.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.460
I spy Ran over there!

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.580
Hi, Ran!

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.000
Got a date with Rei?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.790
<b>TWITCH!</b>

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Wh-what the hell!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.920
Don't spook me like that!

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.290
Have you been making progress with Rei lately?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.460
That's none of your damn business.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.880
Well, I suppose so.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.710
I see what you're up to, Lum!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:35.210
This is a ploy to ditch your darling
and get back with my Rei, isn't it?!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.080
As if! I would never!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.290
And after you had the nerve to dump him!

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.920
You grubby tramp!

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.750
Trying to talk with her was a mistake...
I'll never let you live down<b></b>

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.380
what you did to Rei, ya hear me!

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.830
I AIN'T LOSING TO YOU!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.710
Here! Eat this, Rei!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.710
<b>Anko Pathos, the Taste of Love?!</b>

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.210
Say "ahhh".

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.670
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.920
Is it good?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.920
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.080
Yeah.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.040
Here. One more.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.420
It's filled with anko bean paste.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:45.880
I realize it's likely that Rei is actually
only here for the food, but...

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.290
That's fine.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.130
I'm happy just being with him!

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:53.630
<b>SMOOTH</b>

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.210
Uh, Rei...?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.830
R-Rei just gave me a kiss...

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.080
A-and this definitely isn't a dream!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.000
Oh my god...

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.080
Oh my god!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.790
THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIIIFE!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.790
<b>THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIIIFE!</b>

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.170
Why hello there, Lummy-poo!

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.830
I've been waiting for you!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.670
She's gotta be cooking up another scheme...

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.500
What's the matter, Lummy-poo?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.380
Here, have some tea!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.040
N-no thanks! My tummy is too full right now.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.460
Oh, but you must!
We're going to toast to being friends again!

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.250
You can't skip out on that!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.250
Huh? We're friends again?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.250
Yep!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.750
What brought this on?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.630
Aw shucks!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.790
I'm all blushy just thinking about it!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.250
Okay, but that doesn't explain anything...

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:04.830
Gosh! Don't make me say it!
You're such a meany, Lummy-poo!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:07.290
All right. I'm gonna head out.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.000
Hold yer horses!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.380
Dammit! Ain'tcha gonna listen
to my big news?!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.500
Are you gonna tell me or not?

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.040
Cheeeers!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.130
Squee!

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.710
I have no idea what's going on.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.540
So, like, the other day...

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.420
I was hanging with Rei...

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.130
...and he kissed me.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.170
Huh? What did you say?

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.420
Rei kissed me.

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:34.460
Hm?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.420
Rei... he kissed me.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:37.540
What?

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:43.670
WHAT PART OF REI FRIGGIN' KISSED ME
DON'T YOU GET, YA NINNY?!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:44.580
<b>RING</b>

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.330
Is that really true, Ran?

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.420
OF COURSE IT IS!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.670
Squeeeee!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.290
Congratulations!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:54.000
That's wonderful! I'm so happy for you!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.460
Lummy-poo?

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.580
Are you genuinely happy for me?

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.460
You bet I am!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>Awwwww...</b>

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.380
LUM!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.670
Shucks! I guess you're
a decent friend after all!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.670
<b>THUMP</b>

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.580
I thought she was gonna kill me...
Thanks for everything!<b></b>

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.080
<b>YAHOOO!</b>

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.710
This is great! I don't have to worry about
getting harassed by Ran anymore!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.330
Darling, I'm home!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.540
LUM!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.290
<b>LUM!</b>

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.420
<b>LUM!</b>

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.420
<b>FLOPPO!</b>

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.880
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING HERE?!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.290
<b>BWAH?</b>

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:27.460
He said he was longing to see you.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.920
You can't be serious!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.670
Lum.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.210
Don't even! I know that you kissed Ran!

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.250
F-for real?!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.750
Are you trying to two-time Ran
behind her back or what?!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.170
You womanizer!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.750
Hey dirtbag!
How dare you lay a hand on my Ran!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.380
And just what is that supposed to mean?!

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.460
Lum.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.130
Whatever, you need to leave!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.460
There's gonna be trouble if Ran
happens to see you here with me...

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.330
Good evening, Lummy-poo!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.040
I was in the mood for more girl talk,
so I came to hang out!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.540
Ran, baby! Great to see you!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.710
<b>KERSLAM!</b>

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.290
Rei? What are you doing here?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.790
O-oh, you know!
He just came to say goodbye to me!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:06.630
Lum.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:07.210
<b>WHACK!</b>

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.500
I see what's going on here, Lum.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.330
Ran, my sweet!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.000
<b>WHACK!</b>

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:13.130
Dammit! You're all desperate for Rei
now that he's no longer yours!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.630
You've got it all wrong!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:14.630
<b>WHACK!</b>

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.750
And after you gave me that kiss...

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.380
you're breaking my heart, Rei!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:19.920
A kiss...

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>BWAH?</b>

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.210
Come on, Rei!
Don't you remember anything?!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.380
I was so happy...

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.210
But you don't even remember...

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.580
Unbelievable!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.920
This is too cruel!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.670
You poor thing. Feel free to cry on my lap.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.040
Oh, Ran...

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.500
Boo-hoo! Boo-hoo-hoo!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.580
Boo-hoo! Boo-hoo-hoo!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.500
<b>SMACK!</b>

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.040
Just leave me alone!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.420
The cat says ya should perk up
and try eatin' this!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.130
A taiyaki waffle...

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:07.750
Seeing this just brings back
too many sad memories for me.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:15.330
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.130
I'll devour it!

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.830
Screw the waffle!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.710
And these stupid memories!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.630
Rei?

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.290
The anko...

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.040
<b>SMOOOOOOCH</b>

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:35.500
<b>PITTER-PATTER</b>

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:40.040
This...

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.750
THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIIIFE!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.210
<b>THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIIIFE!</b>

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.290
Not my Ran...
THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIIIFE!<b></b>

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.250
Lum!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.210
What's the big deal?

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.330
PURE JOOOOOOOOOOOOOY!

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.040
<b>PURE JOOOOOOOOOOOOOY!</b>

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.000
So, Ran.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.250
<b>Memories and a Close Call...</b>

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.250
What is it?

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.080
I honestly don't understand why
you'd want to have tea with me.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.250
What makes you say that?

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.920
You're the only friend that
I have on Earth, Lummy-poo.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.420
And I don't want to be my lonesome!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.380
Well, your personality always changes
at the drop of a hat.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.920
It really freaks me out.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:16.880
Oh please!
The blame for that lies entirely on you.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.830
How does that work?!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.500
Let's see.
Remember back when we were five?

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.540
You came over to my place for a sleepover...

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.080
Listen, Ran. No wetting the bed, ya hear?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.040
You're in for a heap of trouble
if it happens again.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.380
G'night, Ran! And little Lum!

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:40.080
Actually, I got in trouble
for doing it yesterday.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:56.880
Switcharoo!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.500
It wasn't my fault!

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.830
Are ya crazy?!
You were sleepin' right on top of the stain!

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.130
Because Lum switched places with me!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.130
What?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.210
Be honest, Lum. Did you do it?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.960
I won't stand for any wrongdoing
around here, missy!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.330
Even though you're a visitor,
I can still punish you!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.670
W-well, it wasn't me...

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:23.710
What?!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.710
Ran!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.210
If Lum says she didn't do it,
then it must have been you!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.290
Trying to pin the blame on someone else

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.750
is one of the most awful things
you can do as a person!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.960
That's just everyday stuff for little kids!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.790
D-don't you dare give me that crap!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.460
It's what happened after...!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.080
There was more that happened afterwards.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.830
Think back carefully.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.330
Sorry Ran...

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.290
I don't wanna talk to you anymore, Lum!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.630
I'll give you my doll, okay?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.170
You will?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.710
Yeah, for sure!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.750
But I thought you'd never
let go of your favorite doll...

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.170
It's okay, it's yours!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.500
So next time, you should come over
to my place for a sleepover!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.830
What a beautiful story of friendship.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.380
Just shut up and stop trying to
change the friggin' subject

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.920
before I get to the most important part!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.880
Can I hug it while I sleep?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.130
You can do whatever
because it's your doll now!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.540
Thanks!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.080
<b>POP</b>

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:44.540
Switcharoo!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.210
Good morning!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.380
Oh, hello there!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:55.250
We weren't expecting you to come so early.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:59.630
I was just worried and wanted to make sure
my little Ran wasn't causing ya any trouble.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.920
Heavens no, she's been an absolute angel.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:06.920
Oh no, not again!

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:10.630
It's nothing to fret about.
She's still young.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.630
Ran!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:13.830
DARN IT!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.040
IT'S BAD ENOUGH YA DO IT AT HOME,
BUT THIS IS EVEN WORSE!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.290
It wasn't my fault!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.380
Oh please, don't be mad at her.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.580
Thanks for having Ran over.
Sorry for the trouble.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.580
I'm gonna take her home now.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.460
You're more than welcome
to stay a little longer...

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.130
Wait, Ran! Don't forget this!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.960
Whaddya mean, Lum?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.290
That doll is yer favorite toy, isn't it?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.000
I gave it to Ran!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.580
Oh my, you're such a sweet girl, Lum!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.540
Ran! Ya should learn from her example!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.500
My mom was a real hellcat, ya know.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.790
After we got back, she spent
the whole afternoon yelling at me!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.420
Ah! One pudding a la mode, please!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.290
Right away, ma'am.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.710
Hey Ran! Let me get that for you!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.540
That's why I ordered it, stupid.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.790
I planned on having you
pay for me from the start.

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:05.330
We had a bet once where the loser
had to treat the winner, remember?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.380
Back when we were eight years old...

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.830
We're gonna hit it with a rock
and then run away!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.920
Whaaat?!

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:16.250
Whoever falls behind has to treat
the other to an ice cream!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.580
But that's dangerous!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.880
And I can't fly in the air like you can, Lum...

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.710
<b>YOU JERKS!</b>

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:26.670
<b>YOU JERKS!</b>

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:26.670
<b>STOMP STOMP</b>

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.880
Oh no, there's a cliff!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.500
Just grab on to me!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.880
<b>KAWHOMP!</b>

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.000
<b>AFTERWARDS</b>

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.330
I told you it was dangerous!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.830
I'll treat you to an ice cream, okay?

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.380
Except, when it ultimately came time to pay...

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:49.500
Hey, Ran!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.080
You gotta pay for half of it!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.130
Huh? You just said you were
gonna buy me one!

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:59.170
And I did, but you still have to treat me
to my ice cream, Ran.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.580
Huh?

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.500
You fell behind earlier!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.920
So I won the bet that we made!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.880
Yeah, that makes perfect sense.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.210
Who cares if it make sense!

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.540
There's a little thing called
showing sympathy, ya know!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.250
I was still forced to pay
the same amount in the end!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.080
Despite having my face smashed into a rock!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.750
It made me feel so stupid!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.380
I'm trying to hear you out,

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.500
but all you've done is tell stories
that make me seem like the bad guy!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.790
WHAT?!

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.630
There are plenty of other times
I've stood up for you, Ran!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.330
Um...
There are plenty of other times<b>
</b>I've stood up for you, Ran!<b></b>

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.000
Not as far as I remember!

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.080
Pardon me.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.500
Huh?

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.880
Here... your pudding a la mode.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:34.750
Golly, I guess those times
must have slipped my mind.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.960
Please, do tell.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.380
There was a time at your house,
when we played darts...

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.920
I got a bullseye!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.250
It's my turn!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.080
Go!

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:57.830
Th-that's not good!
This is my mommy's favorite doll!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.210
Is something the matter?

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.130
Mommy?!

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.130
What was that noise I just heard?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:03.960
Huh?

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.170
My doll is...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:10.460
Sorry miss! It's my fault!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.210
Is that so, Lum?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.670
Hold on. This is one of Ran's darts!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.830
RAN!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.830
I honestly don't care about
what happened to my doll!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.380
But I'm upset with how you acted!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.630
Making it out to be your friend's fault
is totally not okay!

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:32.170
Your obvious lies only made
the situation worse, dammit.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.540
I ended up with this personality
because of you!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.330
It's all your fault, Lum!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.630
You've had it easy your whole life
because you used me as friggin' foot stool!

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:40.670
Huh?!

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:43.130
Hmph! Feeling awful about yourself yet?

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.250
She's absolutely right.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.040
I've treated Ran so terribly all this time...

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:54.830
I really need to learn from
my past mistakes...

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.960
Ah! I feel so much better!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.580
Um, pardon me, miss.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.500
Yes?

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:04.170
Your order of one soda, one fruit parfait,
and one pudding a la mode

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.670
comes out to 1,580 yen.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.080
HERE'S YOUR DAMN MONEY!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.500
I SURE AS HELL WON'T FORGET THIS!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.960
MY RAGE WILL LIVE ON
INTO TOMORROOOOOOW!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.460
<b>Demon Exterminators</b>

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:52.790
<b>Kotobuki</b>

00:16:58.130 --> 00:16:59.960
<b>Adverse Effects</b>

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:15.750
Oh, hey, Lum.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.460
May I ask what you're roasting?

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.710
Some taters?

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.130
Not a potato.

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:24.630
It's a newt.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.540
Why roast a newt?!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.040
To make medicine.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.500
What kind of medicine is that?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.630
It's used in all sorts of treatments.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:36.170
For injuries, headaches, stamina boosters,

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:42.210
stomachaches, colds, diabetes,
and even athlete's foot.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:45.380
Also for things like constipation
and hemorrhoids...

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.580
Oh, and love potion.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.750
This place has a creepy vibe.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.250
Like a witches hut!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:00.960
H, I, J, K, L... Love.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.380
There we go! Love potion!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.380
<b>LOVE POTION</b>

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:05.000
Hurry up and make it!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.460
We'll help you!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.790
Lisen close and no mistakes, okay?

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:14.380
One lizard tail, 10 grams of sugar crystals,
some cat whiskers...

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.960
So, have you used this potion
before, Nurse Sakura?

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.210
What?!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.710
I never needed it because I attracted guys
with my own natural charm!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.170
Oh really?

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.080
I see your hands trembling!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.830
That's a big load of hooey.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.330
I know you used a potion to seduce
that lover boy of yours.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.710
HEY! WHEN THE HELL DID YOU
SLINK IN HERE?!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.130
What a waste of good ingredients.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.420
I doubt this schlock will even work.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.130
But it's gotta work, right?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:40.210
Yeah, there's living proof right here!

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.710
Like I said, I never used the stupid potion!

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:46.880
Okay, next... snake tongue, gelatin,
and a pinch of pepper.

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.710
See? It's written all over your face.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:49.630
<b>KA-THWACK!</b>

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:53.290
To top it off, one charred and minced newt.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.080
And it's complete!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.500
Wow!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:57.960
It looks like candy.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:01.000
Now, just go out there and make the
target of your affections swallow it.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.040
I'll never get how he manages to sleep
in broad daylight like this...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.000
<b>STRETCH</b>

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.540
<b>WHAM!</b>

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.540
I'm full!

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.380
WHAT THE HELL!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.960
Darn it.
Why'd you have to go and wake up?

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:24.420
Nobody could sleep through having
their face pulled on like this!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.830
I have some candy for you.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:28.420
I'll pass.

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.830
It's really good!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.830
I know you're up to something.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:35.630
Well, it's a shame to let
Sakura's present go to waste...

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.460
But whatever. I'll just eat it instead.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.170
Yummy.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:43.880
Hook, line, and sinker!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.380
Lum.

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:50.630
What is it, darling?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.330
I think you're hella cute. Seriously.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.880
So you won't cheat on me anymore?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:59.170
Don't be ridiculous!
I've never cheated on you and never will!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.630
Squeee!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.960
Yeah. I only have eyes for you.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.920
The love potion actually works!

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:09.080
Let's grab a bite to eat somewhere, my treat!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.960
That would be great!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:14.210
Pardon me.
May I have a moment of your time?

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.880
Do you know where the
Ohshima family residence is?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.210
The Ohshima family?

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.210
My condolences.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:23.710
I'm sorry to say that...

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:26.290
a landslide on the hill behind them
wiped out their house recently.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.500
Huh?!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.880
Wh-what happened to the people inside?!

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:32.130
Their desperate attempts to
put out the fire were futile,

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.330
and old age ultimately broke up the family!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.790
Go down that alley.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:38.210
There is a small monument
that was erected in their honor.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.750
Oh my god! This can't be!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.670
Hold on, is there really a hill
behind the Ohshima's place?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:44.880
There totally is!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.630
Actually no. Actually yes.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:49.330
Something feels off about him.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.210
Huh? Is that you, Ataru?

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:52.250
Mom?!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.130
Where are you going?
It's almost time for us to have lunch.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:56.250
Mom...

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.210
Listen, I've been hiding something from you.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:03.080
IT TURNS OUT THAT I'M NOT
ACTUALLY YOUR SON!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.250
<b>WHOOOOOOOOOSH</b>

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.130
My birth parents...

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:11.540
Their last words were for me to take
good care of you and Dad!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.960
I watched them die!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.210
W-well, that's news to me...

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.420
Ataru? Where are you going?

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.670
Out to search for my real parents.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.750
I'm never coming back home.

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:25.750
<b>FREEZE</b>

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.920
Make sure to keep my lunch...
in the fridge.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.460
Gosh, your son must have hit puberty
a little late or something.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.380
He probably just ate something weird.

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:42.830
Now who should I get to eat this?

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.880
Hey, Shinobu!

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.330
Oh. Hi there, Ataru.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.580
Shinobu!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.000
Listen, you're the only one for me!

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:50.210
Uh, what?!

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:51.670
Quit it, darling!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:53.500
You're the only woman I care for.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.380
Wh-where is this coming from?

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.790
What the heck is happening?!

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.130
I made him take the love potion
but it isn't working!

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.080
Huh?

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:03.830
Well, maybe this potion actually
makes them fall in love indiscriminately...

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:04.960
Indiscriminately?!

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.460
My heart has always been yours.

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:09.580
I've never had my sights on
anyone but you, babe!

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:11.830
Are you serious, Ataru?

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.210
<b>KERSMACK!</b>

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:15.540
That's nothing but a big fat lie!

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:18.580
<b>Demon Exterminators</b>

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:18.580
Hm. So, here's the thing.

00:22:18.710 --> 00:22:21.460
It turns out that we actually made
a "loud" potion instead.

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:23.210
"Loud" potion...?

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:25.830
It's a drug that turns people
into loudmouthed liars.

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.000
See?

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:30.080
The "loud" potion and "love" potion
are right next to each other.

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:31.330
An easy mistake to make.

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:32.710
That sucks.

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:35.380
I was planning to give this
to Mendo tomorrow!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:37.170
Sounds like a great idea to me.

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:39.170
It would be funny to see him take it!

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:41.790
Hey.

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:44.080
Have you ever seen me cheat on a girl before?

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:45.500
Never, right?

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:47.920
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:50.960
<b>Family Feud!!</b>

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:50.960
<b>Hello, Sailor Suit!!</b>

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:50.670
YOU DUMBASS OCEAN!
